Contents
--------
  1. almehady/Bijoy-to-Unicode-File-Converter — MIT — conversion tables
  2. Note on a second implementation that was deliberately NOT used
  3. tahmid02016/bangla-wordlist — Unlicense — the embedded Bengali dictionary
